<span id="S7.T3.2.1.1.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S7.T3.2.1.1.1.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:34.5pt;">
<span id="S7.T3.2.1.1.1.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">8</span>
</span></span>
<span id="S7.T3.2.1.1.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S7.T3.2.1.1.1.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:172.5pt;">
<span id="S7.T3.2.1.1.1.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">-, resource, base, barrack, worker, light, heavy, ranged</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="S7.T3.2.1.1.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S7.T3.2.1.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">Current Action</span>
<span id="S7.T3.2.1.1.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="S7.T3.2.1.1.1.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:34.5pt;">
<span id="S7.T3.2.1.1.1.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">6</span>
</span></span>
<span id="S7.T3.2.1.1.1.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="S7.T3.2.1.1.1.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:172.5pt;">
<span id="S7.T3.2.1.1.1.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">-, move, harvest, return, produce, attack</span>
</span></span></span>
</span>
</span>
</span></span></span></p>
</figure>
<div id="S7.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">For action space, shown in Table <a href="#S7.T4" title="TABLE IV ‣ VII-A MicroRTS Environment ‣ VII Appendix ‣ Empowering LLMs with Parameterized Skills for Adversarial Long-Horizon Planning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">IV</span></a>, each action has a <math id="S7.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="78" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>78</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">78</annotation></semantics></math> length of action encoding in MicroRTS.
Thus, there is a <math id="S7.SS1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="78\times wh" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>78</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">78\times wh</annotation></semantics></math>-dimensional action vector in the <math id="S7.SS1.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w\times h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w\times h</annotation></semantics></math> grids map.
For example, if the agent issues a command to a worker at position (0,0) to build a barrack to the south in a <math id="S7.SS1.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\times 2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\times 2</annotation></semantics></math> map, the action will be encoded in the following way:</p>
<table id="S7.EGx1" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex2"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{a}_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{a}_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=[4,0,0,0,2,2,0]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=[4,0,0,0,2,2,0]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex3"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{a}_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{a}_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=[0,0,0,0,0,0,0]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=[0,0,0,0,0,0,0]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex4"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{a}_{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{a}_{3}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=[0,0,0,0,0,0,0]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=[0,0,0,0,0,0,0]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex5"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{a}_{4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{a}_{4}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=[0,0,0,0,0,0,0]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=[0,0,0,0,0,0,0]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><span id="S7.Ex6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">action_tensor</span></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\text{one\_hot}(\text{concat}(\mathbf{a}_{1},\mathbf{a}_{2},\mathbf{a}_{3},\mathbf{a}_{4}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>one_hot</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext>concat</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\text{one\_hot}(\text{concat}(\mathbf{a}_{1},\mathbf{a}_{2},\mathbf{a}_{3},\mathbf{a}_{4}))</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<figure id="S7.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE IV: </span>The Atomic Action Components in MicroRTS. <math id="S7.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{r}=7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{r}=7</annotation></semantics></math> in the maximum attack range.</figcaption>
<p id="S7.T4.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center ltx_align_center"><span id="S7.T4.2.1" class="ltx_text">

<span id="S7.T4.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:62.4pt;vertical-align:-29.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-96.4pt,17.4pt) scale(0.641435458768405,0.641435458768405) ;">
