<section id="S7.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S7.SS2.6" class="ltx_text">VII-B</span> </span><span id="S7.SS2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Question-Answering on MicroRTS</span></h3>

<div id="S7.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The question-answer pairs consist of five straightforward questions manually designed by authors, shown below.</p>
</div>
<div id="S7.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="S7.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="S7.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="S7.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">How many time units does it take to build the Base in MicroRTS?</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="S7.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">How many hit points of the Barrack in MicroRTS?</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="S7.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">How many resources does it cost to build the Light in MicroRTS?</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="S7.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">How many time units does it take to build the Light in MicroRTS?</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<div id="S7.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">How much damage does the attack of the Ranged in MicroRTS?</span></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
<ol id="S7.I2" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="S7.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="S7.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">How many hit points of Terran SCV in StarCraft II (SC2)?</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="S7.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">How many hit points of Zerg Viper in StarCraft II (SC2)?</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="S7.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">How many hit points of Terran Thor in StarCraft II (SC2)?</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="S7.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.I2.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">How many transport slots of Medivac dropship in StarCraft II (SC2)?</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<div id="S7.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.I2.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">How many minerals does it cost to produce a Stalker of Protoss in StarCraft II (SC2)?</span></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
<div id="S7.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">These questions are extracted simply from the corresponding wiki of MicroRTS<span id="footnote3" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">3</span>
              
              
              
            The Wiki URL: <a href="https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/MicroRTS/wiki" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/MicroRTS/wiki</a></span></span></span> and StarCraft II<span id="footnote4" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">4</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">4</sup>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">4</span>
              
              
              
            The StarCraft II Wiki URL: <a href="https://starcraft.fandom.com/wiki/StarCraft_II" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://starcraft.fandom.com/wiki/StarCraft_II</a></span></span></span>, thus there no need extra reasoning to answer the questions. The accuracy of answering can indicate the internal environment-related knowledge of LLMs to a certain degree.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S7.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S7.SS3.6" class="ltx_text">VII-C</span> </span><span id="S7.SS3.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Baseline Bots</span></h3>

<div id="S7.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We have chosen three bots with hard-coded strategies, one search-based bot, and the CoacAI as the best baseline, detailed descriptions<span id="footnote5" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">5</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">5</sup>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">5</span>
              
              
              
            The source is: <a href="https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/MicroRTS/wiki/Artificial-Intelligence" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/MicroRTS/wiki/Artificial-Intelligence</a></span></span></span> as follows:</p>
<ol id="S7.I3" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="S7.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="S7.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">RandomBiasedAI: The RandomBiasedAI moves at random, but with a strong bias towards attacking, harvesting, and returning (5 times more probability).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="S7.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">LightRush: The LightRushAI implements a rush strategy that consists of: training one worker and making it gather resources. Once there are enough resources for building barracks, build a barracks. From that point on, train Light units constantly, and send them to attack immediately to the nearest enemy unit.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="S7.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">WorkerRush: The WorkerRush AI implements another rush strategy that consists of: training workers continuously, making one of them gather resources, and sending all the other ones to attack immediately to the closest enemy unit.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="S7.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">NaiveMCTS: The NaiveMCTSAI is a new Monte-Carlo Tree Search algorithm that combines the naive-sampling idea with MCTS.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I3.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<div id="S7.I3.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I3.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">CoacAI: The CoacAI is the winner of the 2020 competition, designed with handcrafted rules by human experts.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
</section>
